          %p This appears for instance as (Goerss-Jardine, def VI 3.1ardine)).
          %h4#ForSimplicialSetsRelativeVersion Relative version
          #SimplicialPostnikovTowerRelative.num_defn
            %h6#definition_3 Definition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
